      "page": 7,
      "text": "– In contrast, vendor-specific optimizations that are not required for model\nexecution are disabled in the Baseline configuration. These include fine-\ntuning, mixed precision, weight compression, enhanced quantization, graph-\nlevel performance optimization, and resource-allocation tuning. These op-\ntimizations are enabled only in the vendor-guided configurations, allowing\ntheir effects on performance and accuracy to be measured relative to the\nBaseline.",
